{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":65300,\"title\":\"The Real Housewives of Potomac\",\"tagline\":\"The word on the street is that I’m the word on the street.\",\"overview\":\"Just up the river from our nation’s capital lies a hidden gem—Potomac, Maryland. Its rolling hills, gated mansions, sophisticated prep schools, and exclusive country clubs all serve to keep the area invitation-only. Sprinkled throughout this community are a handful of old-line, wealthy African-American families who have historically broken racial barriers to provide a life of privilege for their children. In a town where entry is granted only through class, pedigree, and lineage, how far will the ladies go to secure their spot at the top of this prestigious circle?\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bkUgqsXnWlzqJCaWMwR1DGqPiAq.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8PkQKCE8rTFTUmGrP47FgaXLTNQ.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":5.9,\"voteCount\":47,\"year\":2016,\"genres\":[\"Reality\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":11,\"totalEpisodes\":203,\"createdBy\":[\"Scott Dunlop\"],\"networks\":[\"Bravo\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2026-11-01\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1581238,\"name\":\"Gizelle Bryant\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q8YLWeLSqvEnAEEyIl82rpV8bzu.jpg\"},{\"id\":1581240,\"name\":\"Karen Huger\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qGHdKsVlFgXC4FKzL9S7wXbYsg7.jpg\"},{\"id\":1581243,\"name\":\"Ashley Darby\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nUZ7zqYJuFh0CRkjyxxRFfh8PTL.jpg\"},{\"id\":2829182,\"name\":\"Wendy Osefo\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/acayzAZb1NSp3tc3l4YDW9VEGBA.jpg\"},{\"id\":5045260,\"name\":\"Stacey Rusch\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/